OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant activist Daniel
OL,4,AThomas jailed for 15 months for
OL,5,Aslashing dinghy
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas,
OL,8,Falso known as Danny Tommo, has been
OL,9,Fjailed for 15 months for criminal
OL,10,Fdamage, after he admitted slashing a
OL,11,Fdinghy with a knife in the English
OL,12,FChannel in September
OL,14,FAs he passed sentenced, Judge James
OL,15,FNewton-Price KC described Thomas as a
OL,16,F"publicity seeker", adding his actions
OL,17,Famounted to "deliberate disruption" to
OL,18,Fthe efforts of rescue workers
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
