OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant activist Daniel
OL,4,AThomas jailed for 15 months for
OL,5,Aslashing dinghy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas, 37, had been livestreaming on a
OL,8,Fboat while he observed the migrant
OL,9,Foccupants of the dinghy being taken off
OL,10,Fby the RNLI, Border Force and the
OL,11,FFrench Coastguard
OL,13,FHe then used a knife to slash holes in
OL,14,Fthe dinghy, which had French personnel
OL,15,Fon board
OL,17,FThomas could be heard saying: "This is
OL,18,Fwhat needs to happen to everyone in
OL,19,Fthese boats"
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
